OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge review 'emotional read'
OL,4,Afor security victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who experienced a naked man
OL,7,Fperforming sex acts outside her
OL,8,FTravelodge hotel room says a review
OL,9,Finto the chain's security was an
OL,10,F"emotional read".
OL,12,FWendy Griffith was one of dozens of
OL,13,Fpeople who shared their stories after
OL,14,Fthe BBC revealed how a woman woke up to
OL,15,Fa man sexually assaulting her in her
OL,16,Fbed at the chain's Maidenhead branch in
OL,17,FDecember 2022 after staff gave him a
OL,18,Fkey card and her room number.
