OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge review 'emotional read'
OL,4,Afor security victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FGriffith said she felt "sadness and
OL,7,Ffrustration that women had to go
OL,8,Fthrough these experiences" for the
OL,9,Freview to happen and she wants lessons
OL,10,Fto be learnt across the industry.
OL,12,FTravelodge said it welcomes the
OL,13,Frecommendations from the report and
OL,14,Fchanges have been under way since
OL,15,FMarch.
